OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1786918698
OL,3,CFour Renaissance classics stolen from
OL,4,CSicilian museum during Italian holiday
OL,6,FThe works have been attributed to
OL,7,FRenaissance painter Antonello da
OL,8,FMessina.
OL,10,F"We are devastated by what happened.
OL,11,FThey were two of Antonello da
OL,12,FMessina's most important and best-
OL,13,Fknown works. It is a tremendous loss
OL,14,Ffor the museum, the city, the
OL,15,Fcommunity and the art world," MuMe
OL,16,Fdirector Marisa Mercurio told the ANSA
OL,17,Fnews agency.
OL,26,@rD@AOUwD@]O]
