OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1786918698
OL,3,CFour Renaissance classics stolen from
OL,4,CSicilian museum during Italian holiday
OL,6,FShe said the theft occurred just
OL,7,Fbefore 10pm on Saturday during the
OL,8,FFerragosto holiday, and described the
OL,9,Fworks as central to the region's
OL,10,Fheritage.
OL,12,F"These are not merely works by
OL,13,FAntonello da Messina," she told Sky
OL,14,FTG24. "They are works that hold
OL,15,Fconsiderable significance in terms of
OL,16,Four identity, as well as, of course,
OL,17,Ftheir artistic and cultural value,
OL,18,Fbecause they are works by our very own
OL,19,FAntonello da Messina."
OL,26,@tD@AOUuD@VO]vD@GOU{D@VO]
