OL,3,CFour Renaissance classics stolen from
OL,4,CSicilian museum during Italian holiday
OL,6,FMessina's top culture official, Enzo
OL,7,FCaruso, called the theft "more than a
OL,8,Floss" and "a disaster."
OL,10,F"Messina without Antonello is deprived
OL,11,Fof the very essence of the greatest
OL,12,Fartist of the European Renaissance,"
OL,13,FCaruso told Sky, calling for the swift
OL,14,Frecovery of the stolen works.
