OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1786918698
OL,3,CFour Renaissance classics stolen from
OL,4,CSicilian museum during Italian holiday
OL,6,FCaruso noted that international
OL,7,Finterest in the artist had intensified
OL,8,Fsince Italy's Culture Ministry
OL,9,Facquired Antonello's devotional
OL,10,Fpainting "Ecce Homo" for #11m through
OL,11,Fnegotiations with Sotheby's in New
OL,12,FYork earlier this year.
OL,14,FThe museum was closed on Sunday while
OL,15,Finvestigators gathered evidence.
OL,16,FNeither museum officials nor the
OL,17,FCarabinieri could immediately be
OL,18,Freached for comment.
