OL,3,CFour Renaissance classics stolen from
OL,4,CSicilian museum during Italian holiday
OL,6,FThe Ferragosto holiday, which marks
OL,7,Fthe feast of the Assumption of Mary,
OL,8,Fmarks the height of the Italian summer
OL,9,Fholiday season.
OL,11,FThe theft comes just days after police
OL,12,Fin the northern Italian city of Parma
OL,13,Fannounced that they had recovered
OL,14,Fthree stolen artworks by Renoir,
OL,15,FCezanne and Matisse worth about #8.5m.
OL,17,FFive people have been detained in
OL,18,Fconnection with the theft from the
OL,19,FMagnani Rocca Foundation located in
OL,20,Fthe Parma province.
